------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  lam_conf(m=0, L=8) = 0.000e+00   (k=0 mode of P = -Delta; the measure is not normalisable
   on that direction -- equivalently, along the torus the constant mode is free)
    [PASS] 4.1 free massless -> lam_conf = 0 0.00e+00
  => the configuration-space Poincare constant is NOT sign-blind: it vanishes exactly where
     the physical gap vanishes.  It cannot certify the gap only because of its MAGNITUDE
     (it is a lower bound at best, with the factor m/2 loss above), not because of its SPACE.

